there are 66,667,000 ordinary shares issued and outstanding, including </FONT>16,667,000 ordinary shares represented by 3,333,400 American
depositary shares (&ldquo;ADSs&rdquo;) that Lixiang has publicly issued<FONT STYLE="background-color: white">.</FONT> Each ADS represents
5 ordinary shares, subject to share division, share consolidation, adjustment of conversion ratio between ordinary share and ADS, recapitalization
or other similar events.</FONT></P>

